    "lines": [
      "Machines of Understanding Through Circuits asks what a representation must preserve for reasoning to continue.",
      "It begins with a simple gap: a system can execute, verify, or discover very different things.",
      "The book proposes circuits as explicit structures of operations, dependencies, and partial information."
